{"articleNo":"70582","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=70582&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 동계 계절수업 대구통학버스 운행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.27","hit":"6237","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2012학년도 동계계절수업을 진행함에 따라 대구지역에서 등, 하교하는 학생들의 교통편의를 제공하는 대구통학버스 운행을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;1. 후원금 모금</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 납입금액 : 금90,000원(1인당 : 3,000원×2회×15일)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : 2012. 12. 5.(수) ~ 12. 18.(화)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#000000\">(</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">납부기간이후에는 납입이 불가함<font color=\"#000000\">)</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 금융기관 : 농협 및 대구은행</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 납부방법 : 원스톱서비스에서 학생지원-대구통학버스신청 메뉴에서 후원금 고지서(개인별 가상계좌 번호)를 발급하여 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2. 대구통학버스 운행</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 운행조건 : 2대 각2회(등,하교) 운행</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 운행기간 : 2012. 12. 24(월) ~ 2013. 1. 16(수) [15일, 토요일,공휴일 제외]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제외일자 : 1. 9(수) [1일]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 운행대수 : 45인승 2대</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">단, 후원금 납부인원에 따라 증,감차 또는 노선을 변경할 수 있음</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">마. 운행노선&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 등교</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 만촌역(07:20)→범어로타리(07:25)→<strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">시민회관(07:35)→평리네거리(07:45)→</font></strong>학교(08:40)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 서부정류장(07:20)→광장코아(07:30)→성서홈플러스(07:40)→학교(08:40)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 하교</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:20)→평리네거리(19:10)→시민회관(19:20)→범어네거리(19:25)→남부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학교(18:20)→성서홈플러스(19:10)→광장코아(19:20)→서부정류장(19:30)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 11. 27.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAM